  "body": "Promoted from P3 audit bundle #1193. Original findings:\n\n`tool/strip_sample_features.dart` (`_checkWorkingTree`, ~875): `git status --porcelain` covers the whole repository, so in a monorepo an untracked file outside the project makes the strip refuse (`?? other_notes.txt`), leaving only `--force`. Criterion: status scoped to the project directory; a test with a dirty sibling path proceeds.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- status scoped to the project directory; a test with a dirty sibling path proceeds.\n- Required host checks and applicable workflow dispatches pass; evidence names each criterion. Parent #1193 is checked only after this issue closes.\n"
}
